WEBVTT

00:00:57.637 --> 00:01:00.014
But on the heels
of the civil rights movement

00:01:00.056 --> 00:01:04.977
and a predictable,
because it was cyclical, crime wave,

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:07.605
we decided that rehabilitation
no longer worked.

00:01:08.356 --> 00:01:10.775
In fact, our policymakers said

00:01:10.775 --> 00:01:14.237
that nothing worked for people like them.

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:17.073
That is to say, the people
that we lock away

00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:18.783
in our American jails and prisons,

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:22.411
the kinds of people that we put in a cage.

00:01:24.288 --> 00:01:27.458
We made a political decision
in that moment

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.836
that what we would do

00:01:29.877 --> 00:01:34.632
is we would sentence people
to longer terms in prison